\newlabel{tab:loo_model}{{8}{7}{Leave-one-model-out generalization (DCOL, 6-class). Cross-model 6-class accuracy (33\%) drops sharply from within-model (42\%), but binary human-vs-synthetic accuracy remains high (81\%). MAE = 1.12}{table.8}{}}
